  loss is

        -log(exp(-x) * (x^z) / z!)
      = -log(exp(-x) * (x^z)) + log(z!)
      ~ -log(exp(-x)) - log(x^z) [+ z * log(z) - z + 0.5 * log(2 * pi * z)]
